== Fonts ==

The bitmap fonts once carried glyphs for other alphabets, since removed:

* Cyrillic - qMax, unDEFER (Nikolaj Krivchenkov), ASM
* Chinese - Liu Sizhuang, Ingo "grumbel" Ruhnke
* Tatar letters - Bulat Ibrahim
* Greek, Devanagari, Korean, Arabic, and the Belarusian, Serbian and extra
  Chinese letters - Benjamin "GiBy" Leduc

== Images ==

Most images were created either by grumbel or gwater. Check the log for details.

